      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can assist you with developing some general profiles or red flags to identify potential issues. These may include guests who appear disheveled, intoxicated, or aggressive, or those who demonstrate an inability to follow hotel policies. You may also want to lookout for individuals who request overly expensive or hard-to-obtain items, or those who exhibit suspicious behavior, such as excessive cash transactions or attempts to conceal valuables. Additionally, guests who make multiple requests for private rooms or excessive services without having an apparent reason may raise suspicions.",
